        "@type": "Answer",
        "text": "You can try 35+ premium massage chairs in person at our San Jose showroom inside Westfield Oakridge Mall, located at 925 Blossom Hill Rd, Ste 1324, San Jose, CA 95123. We're open 7 days a week."
      }
    },
    {
      "@type": "Question",
      "name": "Is there a massage chair showroom near me in San Jose?",
