        "@type": "Answer",
        "text": "Yes. House of Massage Chairs operates a flagship showroom inside Westfield Oakridge Mall in San Jose. We serve customers throughout San Jose, Santa Clara, Cupertino, Campbell, Los Gatos, Sunnyvale, Milpitas, and the broader Silicon Valley and South Bay area."
      }
    },
    {
      "@type": "Question",
      "name": "Can I compare different massage chairs in person?",
      "acceptedAnswer": {
        "@type": "Answer",
        "text": "Absolutely. Our San Jose showroom displays 35+ models from 9 premium global brands side by side, so you can compare massage styles, sizes, recline positions, and features before making a decision."
      }
    },
    {
      "@type": "Question",
      "name": "Do you carry premium massage chairs in your San Jose store?",
      "acceptedAnswer": {
        "@type": "Answer",
        "text": "Yes. We carry a curated selection of premium massage chairs from brands including Osaki, Infinity, Fujiiryoki, Bodyfriend, Kyota, JP Medics, Ogawa, and Cozzia. Every chair on our floor is available to experience in person."
      }
    },
    {
      "@type": "Question",
      "name": "Is it better to try a massage chair before buying?",
      "acceptedAnswer": {
        "@type": "Answer",
        "text": "We strongly believe so, and most of our customers agree. A massage chair is a high-consideration purchase. Comfort, fit, pressure preference, and feature usability are things you need to feel — not just read about. Visiting our showroom before buying significantly reduces the chance of post-purchase regret."
      }
    },
    {
      "@type": "Question",
      "name": "What areas near San Jose do you serve?",
      "acceptedAnswer": {
        "@type": "Answer",
        "text": "Our San Jose showroom is the go-to destination for customers across the South Bay and Silicon Valley, including Santa Clara, Cupertino, Campbell, Los Gatos, Sunnyvale, Milpitas, Saratoga, and Palo Alto."
      }
    },
    {
      "@type": "Question",
      "name": "Do you offer zero gravity massage chairs?",
      "acceptedAnswer": {
        "@type": "Answer",
        "text": "Yes. We carry a wide selection of zero gravity massage chairs and full body massage chairs at our San Jose showroom. You can experience zero gravity recline positions in person on multiple models."
      }
    },
    {
      "@type": "Question",
      "name": "Can I visit the showroom before making a decision?",
      "acceptedAnswer": {
        "@type": "Answer",
        "text": "Absolutely — that's exactly what we encourage. There is no pressure to buy during your visit. Come in, try chairs at your own pace, ask questions, and leave with a clear sense of what's right for you."
      }
    },
    {
      "@type": "Question",
      "name": "Do you have massage chairs for sale near San Jose?",
      "acceptedAnswer": {
        "@type": "Answer",
        "text": "Yes. Our San Jose showroom carries premium massage chairs available for immediate purchase, with white-glove delivery and financing options available. You can also browse and order from our full collection online."
      }
    },
    {
      "@type": "Question",
      "name": "What makes House of Massage Chairs in San Jose different?",
      "acceptedAnswer": {
        "@type": "Answer",
        "text": "Unlike a single-brand store or an online retailer, we offer a true multi-brand showroom experience with 35+ chairs from 9 global brands on display. Our knowledgeable team provides guided, no-pressure consultations to help you find the right chair for your body, lifestyle, and budget."
      }
    }
  ]
}
</script>

<style>
  /* =========================================
     RESET & BASE
  ========================================= */
  .sj-wrap *, .sj-wrap *::before, .sj-wrap *::after {
    box-sizing: border-box;
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
  }
  .sj-wrap {
    font-family: 'Inter', system-ui, -apple-system, sans-serif;
    color: #0a0a0a;
    font-size: 16px;
    line-height: 1.75;
    font-weight: 500;
    -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
    -moz-osx-font-smoothing: grayscale;
  }
  .sj-wrap img  { display: block; max-width: 100%; }
  .sj-wrap a    { color: inherit; text-decoration: none; }

  /* =========================================
     DESIGN TOKENS
  ========================================= */
  .sj-wrap {
    --dark:        #000;
    --surface:     #f8fafc;
    --surface2:    #f1f5f9;
    --muted:       #4a4a4a;
    --muted2:      #888;
    --accent:      #b38b4d;
    --accent-h:    #96723e;
    --accent-pale: rgba(179,139,77,.10);
    --border:      #e2e8f0;
    --border2:     #cbd5e1;
    --radius:      20px;
    --radius-sm:   12px;
    --shadow:      0 8px 30px rgba(0,0,0,.07);
    --shadow-lg:   0 20px 50px rgba(0,0,0,.11);
  }

  /* =========================================
     LAYOUT
  ========================================= */
  .sj-wrap .sj-container        { max-width: 1200px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 2rem; }
  .sj-wrap .sj-container-narrow { max-width: 860px;  margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 2rem; }
  .sj-wrap .sj-section           { padding: 80px 0; }
  .sj-wrap .sj-section-alt       { background: var(--surface); }
  .sj-wrap .sj-section-dark {
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #050505 0%, #180f06 60%, #050505 100%);
    position: relative;
    overflow: hidden;
  }
  .sj-wrap .sj-section-dark::before {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    top: -30%;
    right: -5%;
    width: 600px;
    height: 600px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: radial-gradient(circle, rgba(179,139,77,.08) 0%, transparent 70%);
    pointer-events: none;
  }
  .sj-wrap .sj-section-dark::after {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    bottom: -20%;
    left: -5%;
    width: 400px;
    height: 400px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: radial-gradient(circle, rgba(179,139,77,.05) 0%, transparent 70%);
    pointer-events: none;
  }
  .sj-wrap .sj-rel { position: relative; z-index: 1; }

  /* =========================================
     SECTION HEADERS
  ========================================= */
  .sj-wrap .sj-section-header { text-align: center; margin-bottom: 52px; }
  .sj-wrap .sj-eyebrow {
    display: inline-block;
    font-size: 11px;
    font-weight: 800;
    letter-spacing: .2em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--accent);
    margin-bottom: 14px;
  }
  .sj-wrap .sj-section-header h2 {
    font-size: clamp(28px, 3.5vw, 44px);
    font-weight: 900;
    letter-spacing: -.025em;
    line-height: 1.1;
    margin-bottom: 16px;
  }
  .sj-wrap .sj-section-header h2::before {
    content: '';
    display: block;
    width: 40px;
    height: 3px;
    background: var(--accent);
    margin: 0 auto 20px;
    border-radius: 2px;
  }
  .sj-wrap .sj-section-header.sj-left h2::before { margin-left: 0; }
  .sj-wrap .sj-section-header p {
    font-size: 17px;
    color: var(--muted);
    max-width: 640px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    line-height: 1.8;
    font-weight: 400;
  }

  /* =========================================
     BUTTONS
  ========================================= */
  .sj-wrap .sj-btn {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    gap: 8px;
    background: var(--dark);
    color: #fff;
    padding: 16px 36px;
    font-size: 15px;
    font-weight: 700;
    border-radius: 50px;
    border: 2px solid var(--dark);
    transition: all .25s;
    cursor: pointer;
    font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;
    white-space: nowrap;
  }
  .sj-wrap .sj-btn:hover { background: #222; border-color: #222; transform: translateY(-2px); box-shadow: 0 8px 20px rgba(0,0,0,.15); }
  .sj-wrap .sj-btn-gold  { background: var(--accent); border-color: var(--accent); color: #fff; }
  .sj-wrap .sj-btn-gold:hover { background: var(--accent-h); border-color: var(--accent-h); box-shadow: 0 8px 20px rgba(179,139,77,.3); }
  .sj-wrap .sj-btn-outline { background: transparent; color: var(--dark); border-color: var(--border2); }
  .sj-wrap .sj-btn-outline:hover { border-color: var(--dark); background: var(--surface); }
  .sj-wrap .sj-btn-ghost { background: rgba(255,255,255,.08); color: #fff; border-color: rgba(255,255,255,.55); }
  .sj-wrap .sj-btn-ghost:hover { background: rgba(255,255,255,.18); border-color: rgba(255,255,255,.9); }
  .sj-wrap .sj-btn-sm { padding: 11px 24px; font-size: 14px; }

  /* =========================================
     HERO
  ========================================= */
  .sj-wrap .sj-hero {
    position: relative;
    min-height: 92vh;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    text-align: center;
    background: #000;
    overflow: hidden;
  }
  .sj-wrap .sj-hero-bg {
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    overflow: hidden;
  }
  .sj-wrap .sj-hero-bg img {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    object-fit: cover;
    object-position: center 30%;
    display: block;
    opacity: .38;
    animation: sj-zoom 14s ease-in-out infinite alternate;
  }
  @keyframes sj-zoom { from { transform: scale(1.00); } to { transform: scale(1.06); } }
  .sj-wrap .sj-hero-overlay {
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    background: linear-gradient(to bottom, rgba(0,0,0,.1) 0%, rgba(0,0,0,.65) 100%);
  }
  .sj-wrap .sj-hero-content {
    position: relative;
    z-index: 2;
    padding: 120px 2rem 100px;
    max-width: 900px;
  }
  .sj-wrap .sj-hero-badge {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 8px;
    background: rgba(179,139,77,.2);
    border: 1px solid rgba(179,139,77,.4);
    color: #e8c77a;
    font-size: 11px;
    font-weight: 800;
    letter-spacing: .16em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    padding: 8px 20px;
    border-radius: 50px;
    margin-bottom: 30px;
  }
  .sj-wrap .sj-hero-badge-dot {
    width: 6px;
    height: 6px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: #e8c77a;
    animation: sj-blink 2s ease-in-out infinite;
  }
  @keyframes sj-blink { 0%,100%{opacity:1} 50%{opacity:.3} }

  .sj-wrap .sj-hero h1 {
    font-size: clamp(38px, 6.5vw, 76px);
    font-weight: 900;
    color: #fff;
    letter-spacing: -.03em;
    line-height: 1.05;
    margin-bottom: 24px;
    text-shadow: 0 2px 28px rgba(0,0,0,.35);
  }
  .sj-wrap .sj-hero h1 span { color: var(--accent); }
  .sj-wrap .sj-hero-sub {
    font-size: clamp(16px, 1.8vw, 21px);
    color: rgba(255,255,255,.82);
    max-width: 640px;
    margin: 0 auto 38px;
    line-height: 1.7;
    font-weight: 400;
  }
  .sj-wrap .sj-hero-ctas {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 12px;
    justify-content: center;
    margin-bottom: 52px;
  }
  .sj-wrap .sj-hero-trust {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    justify-content: center;
    gap: 10px;
    padding-top: 32px;
    border-top: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.18);
  }
  .sj-wrap .sj-hero-trust-item {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 8px;
    color: rgba(255,255,255,.9);
    font-size: 13px;
    font-weight: 700;
    background: rgba(255,255,255,.09);
    border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.16);
    padding: 9px 18px;
    border-radius: 50px;
    backdrop-filter: blur(6px);
  }
  .sj-wrap .sj-hero-trust-item svg { fill: var(--accent); flex-shrink: 0; }

  /* =========================================
     TRUST BAR
  ========================================= */
  .sj-wrap .sj-trust-bar {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
    gap: 40px;
    padding: 22px 2rem;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
    font-size: 14px;
    font-weight: 700;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    background: #fff;
  }
  .sj-wrap .sj-trust-item { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px; color: var(--muted); }
  .sj-wrap .sj-trust-item svg { width: 18px; height: 18px; fill: var(--accent); flex-shrink: 0; }

  /* =========================================
     SHOWROOM INFO CARD
  ========================================= */
  .sj-wrap .sj-info-band {
    background: var(--surface);
    padding: 56px 0;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
  }
  .sj-wrap .sj-info-card {
    background: #fff;
    border: 1px solid rgba(179,139,77,.22);
    border-radius: 24px;
    overflow: hidden;
    box-shadow: 0 16px 48px rgba(0,0,0,.08);
    max-width: 1080px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }
  .sj-wrap .sj-info-card-head {
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #080808 0%, #1c1005 60%, #080808 100%);
    padding: 32px 40px 28px;
    position: relative;
    overflow: hidden;
  }
  .sj-wrap .sj-info-card-head::after {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    right: -60px;
    top: -60px;
    width: 280px;
    height: 280px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: radial-gradient(circle, rgba(179,139,77,.12) 0%, transparent 70%);
    pointer-events: none;
  }
  .sj-wrap .sj-info-card-label {
    font-size: 10px;
    font-weight: 800;
    letter-spacing: .22em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--accent);
    margin-bottom: 10px;
    display: block;
  }
  .sj-wrap .sj-info-card-head h2 {
    font-size: clamp(22px, 3vw, 34px);
    font-weight: 900;
    color: #fff;
    letter-spacing: -.025em;
    line-height: 1.1;
    margin-bottom: 6px;
  }
  .sj-wrap .sj-info-card-head p {
    font-size: 15px;
    color: rgba(255,255,255,.52);
    font-weight: 400;
    margin: 0;
  }
  .sj-wrap .sj-info-card-body {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1.1fr 1fr;
    gap: 0;
  }
  .sj-wrap .sj-info-details {
    padding: 32px 40px;
    border-right: 1px solid var(--border);
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 20px;
  }
  .sj-wrap .sj-info-row {
    display: flex;
    align-items: flex-start;
    gap: 13px;
  }
  .sj-wrap .sj-info-row-icon {
    flex-shrink: 0;
    width: 34px;
    height: 34px;
    background: var(--accent-pale);
    border-radius: 8px;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    margin-top: 2px;
  }
  .sj-wrap .sj-info-row-icon svg { width: 16px; height: 16px; fill: var(--accent); }
  .sj-wrap .sj-info-row-text {}
  .sj-wrap .sj-info-row-label {
    font-size: 10px;
    font-weight: 800;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: .12em;
    color: var(--accent);
    display: block;
    margin-bottom: 3px;
  }
  .sj-wrap .sj-info-row-val {
    font-size: 14px;
    color: #1a1a1a;
    line-height: 1.55;
    font-weight: 600;
  }
  .sj-wrap .sj-info-row-val a { color: #1a1a1a; transition: color .2s; }
  .sj-wrap .sj-info-row-val a:hover { color: var(--accent); }
  .sj-wrap .sj-serving-chips {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 6px;
    margin-top: 4px;
  }
  .sj-wrap .sj-chip {
    font-size: 12px;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--muted);
    background: var(--surface2);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    padding: 4px 10px;
    border-radius: 20px;
  }
  .sj-wrap .sj-info-map {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
  }
  .sj-wrap .sj-info-map iframe {
    flex: 1;
    width: 100%;
    min-height: 260px;
    border: 0;
    display: block;
  }
  .sj-wrap .sj-info-ctas {
    padding: 24px 40px;
    display: flex;
    gap: 10px;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    background: var(--surface);
    border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
  }

  /* =========================================
     WHY VISIT
  ========================================= */
  .sj-wrap .sj-why-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 56px;
    align-items: center;
  }
  .sj-wrap .sj-why-img-wrap {
    border-radius: var(--radius);
    overflow: hidden;
    box-shadow: var(--shadow-lg);
    position: relative;
  }
  .sj-wrap .sj-why-img-wrap img {
    height: 520px;
    object-fit: cover;
    width: 100%;
  }
  .sj-wrap .sj-why-img-badge {
    position: absolute;
    bottom: 24px;
    left: 24px;
    background: rgba(0,0,0,.82);
    backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
    border: 1px solid rgba(179,139,77,.3);
    border-radius: var(--radius-sm);
    padding: 14px 20px;
    color: #fff;
  }
  .sj-wrap .sj-why-img-badge strong {
    display: block;
    font-size: 26px;
    font-weight: 900;
    color: var(--accent);
    letter-spacing: -.02em;
    line-height: 1;
  }
  .sj-wrap .sj-why-img-badge span {
    font-size: 12px;
    color: rgba(255,255,255,.55);
    font-weight: 700;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: .1em;
  }
  .sj-wrap .sj-why-copy { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 24px; }
  .sj-wrap .sj-reason-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 14px; margin-top: 8px; }
  .sj-wrap .sj-reason-card {
    background: var(--surface);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: var(--radius-sm);
    padding: 20px;
    transition: all .25s;
  }
  .sj-wrap .sj-reason-card:hover {
    border-color: var(--accent);
    box-shadow: 0 4px 16px rgba(179,139,77,.12);
    transform: translateY(-2px);
  }
  .sj-wrap .sj-reason-icon {
    width: 38px;
    height: 38px;
    background: rgba(179,139,77,.15);
    border: 1px solid rgba(179,139,77,.2);
    border-radius: 10px;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    margin-bottom: 10px;
  }
  .sj-wrap .sj-reason-icon svg { width: 20px; height: 20px; fill: var(--accent); }
  .sj-wrap .sj-reason-card h4 { font-size: 14px; font-weight: 800; margin-bottom: 5px; letter-spacing: -.01em; }
  .sj-wrap .sj-reason-card p  { font-size: 13px; color: var(--muted); margin: 0; line-height: 1.65; font-weight: 400; }

  /* =========================================
     TRY BEFORE YOU BUY
  ========================================= */
  .sj-wrap .sj-experience-steps {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);
    gap: 0;
    margin-bottom: 56px;
    position: relative;
  }
  .sj-wrap .sj-experience-steps::before {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    top: 28px;
    left: calc(12.5% + 14px);
    right: calc(12.5% + 14px);
    height: 1px;
    background: var(--border2);
  }
  .sj-wrap .sj-exp-step {
    text-align: center;
    padding: 0 20px;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 14px;
  }
  .sj-wrap .sj-exp-num {
    width: 56px;
    height: 56px;
    border-radius: 50%;
